# EKPI environment placeholders.
#
# The current code reads ONLY EKP_GOVERNANCE_DATA (the local governance ledger path).
# The application does not load a .env file automatically.
# Copy this file to a local, git-ignored location only if you set variables in your shell.

# Local governance web prototype (loopback only):
# EKP_GOVERNANCE_DATA=%LOCALAPPDATA%\EKPI\governance-ledger.jsonl

